  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ba2ac043a0776a4d846aaf6ba38a734, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Cuttiing oil
  description: "Cutting oil is a crucial lubricant and coolant used in machining
    processes like lathing and milling. Its main purpose is to reduce the friction
    and intense heat generated between the cutting tool and the workpiece. \r\nThis
    not only extends the tool's life and prevents the workpiece from warping, but
    also ensures a clean, smooth finish. Additionally, it helps to flush metal chips
    away from the cutting area.\r\n\nPlease tell user the knowledge of this cutting
    oil"
  type: 0
  url: 
