  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: FlipTable
  description: "Step 2: Flip the wheel over.\n\nOnce the lathe machining is complete,
    the robotic arm removes the wheel from the lathe machine and places it on the
    flip table. \r\nThe flip table then turns the wheel upside down. Next, the robotic
    arm grabs the now-flipped wheel and places it on the milling machine. This step
    is essential for machining the backside of the wheel and other areas that require
    milling.\r\n"
  type: 0
  url: 
