  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ba2ac043a0776a4d846aaf6ba38a734, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Mill Machine
  description: "Step 3: Place the wheel in the milling machine.\n\nThe robotic arm
    takes the wheel from the flip table and places it on the milling machine. \r\nThe
    milling machine then uses an end mill to process the wheel. \r\nThis involves
    machining the backside to create a flat surface and drilling new bolt holes.\r\n\nAn
    end mill is used to create complex grooves and shapes in areas a lathe can't
    reach, such as the back of the spokes. \r\nIt can also engrave logos and serial
    numbers onto the wheel's surface.\r\n"
  type: 0
  url: 
